  "details": "Certain old avatars appear extremely laggy to remote players, but not locally to the player using it. This behavior still occurs even if the avatar is hidden.\n\nHow to reproduce:\n\n1.) Have at least two players in the instance.\n\n2.) Equip one of these example avatars.\n\n3.) Move around and the person wearing the avatar will appear as though they're lagging very badly to the other players.\n\nSome example avatars it happens with:\n\navtr_d180d579-76f9-4461-aa74-331af5525502\n\navtr_6bfe210a-7175-414a-8da0-250a3cf105f4\n\navtr_2e73db45-21ce-4758-908d-2c6f80c07f30\n\navtr_199dcd82-a752-4279-968a-bcff6550d7b8",
